{
	"Name": "ScheduledSearch - Okta - Access Control - Network Zones - Any Okta Network Zone Change (roll-up)",
	"Description": "Roll-up of every Okta network zone change: create, update, activate, deactivate, delete, and blocklist membership. Use this one when you would rather review all zone churn in a single feed.\n\nEvent types: zone.create, zone.update, zone.activate, zone.deactivate, zone.delete, zone.make_blacklist, zone.remove_blacklist\n\nReference(s):\n- https://developer.okta.com/docs/reference/api/event-types/\n- https://developer.okta.com/docs/api/openapi/okta-management/management/tag/SystemLog/\n\nThis scheduled search is a dispatcher on \"Alert - Okta - Alert Router\". Its name is what appears as the alert name, so rename it here if you want the alerts named differently.\n\nIt ships disabled; enable it once you have reviewed the query and are happy with the volume it produces.",
	"Labels": [
		"okta"
	],
	"Schedule": "30 * * * *",
	"Duration": -3600,
	"DefaultDeploymentRules": {
		"Disabled": true,
		"RunImmediately": false
